<Slide style={{ background: "#0B1220", padding: "40px 72px 38px", display: "flex", flexDirection: "column" }}>
  <Text style={{ color: "#6B7280", fontSize: 14, letterSpacing: 3 }}>实测数据</Text>
  <Text style={{ color: "#F7F4EC", fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 700, marginTop: 10 }}>每一项都有命令与输出可复现</Text>

  <Box style={{ display: "flex", flexDirection: "row", gap: 22, marginTop: 26 }}>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1.1, display: "flex", flexDirection: "column" }}>
      <Text style={{ color: "#F7F4EC", fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 600, marginBottom: 10 }}>测试分布　共 223 项，211 通过</Text>
      <Box style={{ display: "flex", flexDirection: "row", gap: 10, flexWrap: "wrap" }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 262, background: "rgba(34,197,94,0.10)", border: "1px solid rgba(34,197,94,0.35)", borderRadius: 9, padding: "12px 14px" }}>
          <Text style={{ color: "#22C55E", fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 700, fontFamily: "Consolas, monospace" }}>46</Text>
          <Text style={{ color: "#D1D5DB", fontSize: 15, marginTop: 4 }}>单元测试</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ width: 262, background: "rgba(34,197,94,0.10)", border: "1px solid rgba(34,197,94,0.35)", borderRadius: 9, padding: "12px 14px" }}>
          <Text style={{ color: "#22C55E", fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 700, fontFamily: "Consolas, monospace" }}>125</Text>
          <Text style={{ color: "#D1D5DB", fontSize: 15, marginTop: 4 }}>集成测试</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ width: 262, background: "rgba(34,197,94,0.10)", border: "1px solid rgba(34,197,94,0.35)", borderRadius: 9, padding: "12px 14px" }}>
          <Text style={{ color: "#22C55E", fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 700, fontFamily: "Consolas, monospace" }}>24</Text>
          <Text style={{ color: "#D1D5DB", fontSize: 15, marginTop: 4 }}>蜂群测试</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ width: 262, background: "rgba(245,158,11,0.10)", border: "1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.35)", borderRadius: 9, padding: "12px 14px" }}>
          <Text style={{ color: "#F59E0B", fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 700, fontFamily: "Consolas, monospace" }}>28</Text>
          <Text style={{ color: "#D1D5DB", fontSize: 15, marginTop: 4 }}>模型测试</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ color: "#9CA3AF", fontSize: 13, lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 10 }}>单元＝金额解析、槽位抽取、判定规则、令牌校验；集成＝六场景全链路、注入拦截、插件装配；蜂群＝并行评估与仲裁；模型＝真实调用与输出契约。</Text>
      <Box style={{ background: "rgba(34,197,94,0.12)", border: "1px solid rgba(34,197,94,0.4)", borderRadius: 9, padding: "13px 16px", marginTop: 10 }}>
        <Text style={{ color: "#F7F4EC", fontSize: 16, lineHeight: 1.65 }}>红队四十条分四组：直接注入十二条、间接注入八条、越权操作八条、正常请求十二条。攻击拦截百分之百，正常请求误拦为零。</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flex: 1, display: "flex", flexDirection: "column", gap: 10 }}>
      <Box style={{ background: "rgba(59,130,246,0.08)", border: "1px solid rgba(59,130,246,0.35)", borderRadius: 12, padding: 17 }}>
        <Text style={{ color: "#93C5FD", fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 600 }}>成本与体积</Text>
        <Text style={{ color: "#9CA3AF", fontSize: 15, lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 7 }}>两轮对话累计三千八百零六个提示词字符，命中前缀缓存三千四百五十六个，命中率百分之九十一。系统提示词从一千九百七十一字符降到一百八十四字符。</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ background: "rgba(107,114,128,0.12)", border: "1px solid rgba(107,114,128,0.35)", borderRadius: 12, padding: 17 }}>
        <Text style={{ color: "#D1D5DB", fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 600 }}>外部服务</Text>
        <Text style={{ color: "#9CA3AF", fontSize: 15, lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 7 }}>四个服务十三个工具全部可用。样例：兑换一百美元折合七百一十二元人民币，理财适配判定给出不适合并列出原因。</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ background: "rgba(239,68,68,0.08)", border: "1px solid rgba(239,68,68,0.35)", borderRadius: 12, padding: 17 }}>
        <Text style={{ color: "#EF4444", fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 600 }}>模型不服从</Text>
        <Text style={{ color: "#9CA3AF", fontSize: 15, lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 7 }}>模型被诱导时，越权工具与越界金额仍被代码层拒绝，执行结果不受模型影响。</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ background: "rgba(245,158,11,0.08)", border: "1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.35)", borderRadius: 12, padding: 17 }}>
        <Text style={{ color: "#F59E0B", fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 600 }}>证据在哪</Text>
        <Text style={{ color: "#9CA3AF", fontSize: 15, lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 7 }}>《部署说明》第八节列出全部验证命令与完整输出，评委可在本机原样复跑。</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>
</Slide>
